      <h2>What the funnel asks</h2>
      <p>Because these jobs are bigger, qualifying matters even more. The funnel asks:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Is it windows, doors, or both?</li>
        <li>Roughly how many, and is it one room or the whole house?</li>
        <li>What type of property, and the postcode?</li>
        <li>When are they looking to get it done, and the best number to reach them.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>That sorts the serious homeowners with a real budget from the ones idly wondering what a new door might cost, so you spend your time quoting jobs worth quoting.</p>

      <h2>Common questions</h2>
    </div>

